%% Option F. Parts only: static FEM analysis
%% Engineering: a static finite element analysis of a loaded steel bracket.

    Analysis["<b>Static analysis of a bracket</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::local
    Spec["<b>Load case settings</b><br>IAO_0000104 plan specification<br><br>is a: simulation specification"]:::proposed
    Task["<b>Find the stresses under load</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>is a: equilibrium task"]:::proposed
